#
# Manual API tests for Visual Studio / VS Code (REST Client) / JetBrains HTTP Client.
# Put a test document named sample.pdf next to this file before running the analyze requests.
# To test the deployed app, change the host below to your Azure Container Apps URL.

@host = http://localhost:5018

### Health check (not rate limited)
GET {{host}}/health

### Analyze a PDF (expect 200 with page-by-page JSON)
POST {{host}}/api/docintel/analyze
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./sample.pdf
--boundary--

### Unsupported file type (expect 400)
POST {{host}}/api/docintel/analyze
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="notes.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

This is not a supported document type.
--boundary--

### No file uploaded (expect 400)
POST {{host}}/api/docintel/analyze
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary--
